@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram (Smart Traffic Management System)

[*] --> MonitoringTraffic
MonitoringTraffic --> ControlStreetLights : [Traffic conditions detected]
MonitoringTraffic --> ManageSignals : [Traffic conditions detected]
ControlStreetLights --> CaptureVehicleDetails : [Emergency identified or vehicle passes through signal]
CaptureVehicleDetails --> VerifyRules
VerifyRules --> EndProcess : [No action needed]
VerifyRules --> RecordViolation : [Fine not paid]
RecordViolution --> PayFine : [Fine paid]
PayFine --> CompleteProcess : [Fine paid]
RecordViolation --> SendWarning : [Fine not paid]
SendWarning --> ExceedLimit : [Violations exceed limit]
ExceedLimit --> HoldLicense : [Fine cleared or probation period over]

@enduml
